+With `DIGITIZER_MOUSE_PINCH_ENABLE`, two fingers scroll using their midpoint. When the distance between them changes by more than `DIGITIZER_PINCH_THRESHOLD`, and by more than the midpoint has moved, the gesture becomes a pinch until the fingers lift: the modifiers are held (as weak mods) and spreading the fingers scrolls up, which zooms in with `Cmd`+scroll in apps such as Figma.
